sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / Data Scientist
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Webhook as Webhook Service<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS
    participant Controller as RayClusterReconciler
    participant RouteAPI as OpenShift Route API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Secrets as Kubernetes Secrets

    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Note over User,Secrets: Flow 1: RayCluster Creation with OAuth (OpenShift)
        User->>K8sAPI: kubectl create RayCluster<br/>Bearer Token
        K8sAPI->>Webhook: POST /mutate-ray-io-v1-raycluster<br/>TLS (cert-controller)
        Webhook->>Webhook: Inject OAuth proxy sidecar<br/>Inject mTLS init containers<br/>Add env vars and volumes
        Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Mutated RayCluster
        K8sAPI->>Controller: Watch event (RayCluster created)
        Controller->>Secrets: Create CA Secret (RSA-2048)<br/>Create OAuth cookie Secret
        Controller->>K8sAPI: Create ServiceAccount<br/>Create ClusterRoleBinding<br/>Create NetworkPolicies
        Controller->>RouteAPI: Create OAuth Route (dashboard)<br/>Create passthrough Route (RayClient)
    end

    participant Route as OpenShift Route<br/>443/TCP HTTPS edge
    participant OAuthProxy as oauth-proxy sidecar<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Dashboard as Ray Dashboard<br/>8265/TCP HTTP
    participant OAuth as OpenShift OAuth Server

    rect rgb(255, 243, 224)
        Note over User,OAuth: Flow 2: Ray Dashboard Access (OpenShift)
        User->>Route: GET https://ray-dashboard-xxx<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS
        Route->>OAuthProxy: Forward to 8443/TCP<br/>TLS
        OAuthProxy->>OAuth: Redirect to OAuth login<br/>OpenShift OAuth
        OAuth-->>OAuthProxy: OAuth token
        OAuthProxy->>OAuthProxy: Validate via<br/>openshift-delegate-urls<br/>(pod get RBAC)
        OAuthProxy->>Dashboard: Forward to 8265/TCP<br/>HTTP (localhost)
        Dashboard-->>OAuthProxy: Dashboard response
        OAuthProxy-->>Route: Proxied response
        Route-->>User: Dashboard HTML
    end

    participant InitContainer as mTLS Init Container<br/>openssl CLI
    participant CASecret as CA Secret<br/>(mounted volume)
    participant RayHead as Ray Head Node
    participant RayWorker as Ray Worker Node

    rect rgb(232, 245, 233)
        Note over InitContainer,RayWorker: Flow 3: Ray Head-Worker mTLS
        InitContainer->>CASecret: Read CA key/cert<br/>(mounted volume)
        InitContainer->>InitContainer: openssl genrsa RSA-2048<br/>openssl req + x509 sign
        InitContainer->>InitContainer: Write node cert to emptyDir
        RayHead->>RayWorker: gRPC / TCP<br/>mTLS (per-cluster CA)<br/>Certificate auth
        RayWorker-->>RayHead: Response<br/>mTLS encrypted
    end
